## 1. Grant of License

Upon a verified purchase, the copyright holder grants you a limited,
non-exclusive, non-transferable, worldwide license to use LAZARUS according to
the tier purchased. Paid tiers are enforced by the built-in Gumroad license
check (`gumroad/license_check.py`) — keep your license key confidential.

### Lifetime Tier ($199, one-time)

For individual crypto holders:
- Self-host the full dead man's switch (AES-256 + RSA-4096 vault, check-ins,
  beneficiary release, CLI + web UI).
- Unlimited wallets and beneficiaries for your own assets.
- Modify the source code freely; modifications are owned by you.
- Lifetime updates (all v1.x releases).

### Managed Cloud ($49/mo) & Enterprise ($499/mo)

Everything in Lifetime (hosted/white-glove per plan), plus priority support,
custom features (Enterprise), and managed operations. Subscription terms
(fees, cancellation, refunds) follow the plan purchased at checkout.

### Restrictions (all tiers)

You may NOT:
- Redistribute, resell, sublicense, publish, or share the source code or your
  license key, in whole or in part, in original or modified form — including as
